.interaction.review.events.jsonl\n?? reviews/2026-11-18/impl/wp/fixes-verify.interaction.review.md\n4a1db68 (HEAD -> main) Memory budget P7 is 1.1x the caller's two columns (owner's decision)\nbbd7564 Messages gains selectRange for the non-dragging range selection (spec I4, final review C2-8)\n28174df Interaction layer rebuilt to decision 0004 revision 3: one state machine for what is shown (Claude Opus 5.5 high)\n3853361 Controller: paused re-encoding keeps rows with a missing y; Resume from a handler; AX101 cleared on Resume; wider property test (Claude Opus 5.5 high)\n6ebdb6f Controller, eighth pass: the final review's blockers and most of its majors (Claude Opus 5.5 high)\ne55d984 Data stores: missingRow; one copy of x per window; earlier compaction; implicit scatter rows (Claude Opus 5.5 high)\n11fe6da Report of the controller's eighth pass (code follows when its follow-up items are in)\nf184b51 Contract: PointSeries.missingRow; public comment on positions emitted as numbers\n059e269 Data, lookup, scene, reader, diagnostics: final review items (Claude Opus 5.5 high)\n7208470 Status: both final reviews say not yet; three parallel fix passes by Anthropic models under way\n/home/canarit/projects/axylo\nbbd756407299f7a6b2324f75c6e1872e9775d265\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
