= null;\n   122\t        this.prefixStart = 0;\n   123\t      }\n   124\t      return;\n   125\t    }\n   126\t    this.range.start++;\n   127\t    const capacity = this.range.compact(this.positions.length);\n   128\t    if (capacity) this.resize(capacity, 0);\n   129\t  }\n   130\t\n   131\t  /**\n   132\t   * Points the prefix at the store's own window, whose first slots hold the same positions (a wide frame over\n   133\t   * one sorted x column, no gap slots): one copy of x per window, and the caller's column is not pinned.\n   134\t   * Falls back to a copy of the remainder once half of it is gone, as before, if the window does not match.\n   135\t   */\n   136\t  share(window: Float64Array): void {\n   137\t    const prefix = this.prefix;\n   138\t    if (!prefix) return;\n   139\t    const remaining = prefix.length - this.prefixStart;\n   140\t    if (sameRemainder(prefix, this.prefixStart, window)) this.prefix = window.subarray(0, remaining);\n   141\t    else if (this.prefixStart * 2 >= prefix.length) this.prefix = prefix.slice(this.prefixStart);\n   142\t    else return;\n   143\t    this.prefixStart = 0;\n   144\t  }\n   145\t\n   146\t  count(bytes: ByteCount, name: string): void {\n   147\t    bytes.add(name, this.prefix);\n   148\t    if (this.positions.length) bytes.add(name, this.positions);\n   149\t  }\n   150\t\n   151\t  private resize(capacity: number, extra: number): void {\n   152\t    const retained = this.positions.subarray(this.range.start, this.range.end);\n   153\t    this.positions = new Float64Array(capacity);\n   154\t    this.positions.set(retained);\n   155\t    this.range.rebase(extra);\n   156\t  }\n   157\t}\n   158\t\n   159\t/** Whether the first slots of `window` hold `prefix` from `start` on (checked at both ends). */\n   160\tfunction sameRemainder(prefix: Float64Array, start: number, window: Float64Array): boolean {\n   161\t  const remaining = prefix.length - start;\n   162\t  return remaining > 0 && remaining <= window.len